 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Decode with the n-gram tables on SSD (patch `0013-flash-next-ple-page-cache`): a round's cached n-gram reads
+  happen on the engine thread instead of through 16 worker threads (each read cost ~9 us of thread handoff
+  against ~0.4 us for the read), and the next round's rows are hinted to the page cache while the GPU drafts.
